s-slam — Licensing Overview
===========================

This repository is a monorepo that aggregates two independently-licensed
components. There is NO single license covering the whole repository; each
component is governed by its own license. When redistributing this repository
as a whole, the most restrictive applicable terms (GPL, from spark_fast_lio)
apply to the combined/aggregate work.

Components
----------

1. kiss_matcher/        — MIT License
   See: kiss_matcher/LICENSE
   Global point-cloud registration library + ROS 2 SLAM backend
   (kiss_matcher_ros). Upstream: https://github.com/MIT-SPARK/KISS-Matcher

2. spark_fast_lio/      — GNU General Public License (GPL)
   See: spark_fast_lio/LICENSE
   LiDAR-inertial odometry frontend (modified Fast-LIO2).
   Upstream: https://github.com/MIT-SPARK/spark-fast-lio

3. third_party/         — see each subdirectory for its own license
   Vendored / fetched dependencies (ikd-Tree, IKFoM_toolkit, and the
   FetchContent helper scripts for Eigen, TBB, ROBIN, TEASER++, etc.).
   These retain their respective upstream licenses.

Note
----
Because spark_fast_lio is GPL-licensed, any distribution of a combined work
built from both components must comply with the GPL. Keep each component's
LICENSE file intact.
